  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.12.1\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\n### Breaking Changes 🛠\n* fix: Cast null to 0 in arithmetic expressions by @TomasEng in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1751\n### New Features 🎉\n* Rewrite app lib to support streaming of attachments by @MagnusHAa in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1734\n* feat: Add binary update support to instance data mutator by @bjorntore in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1754\n* feat: Allow any number of operands in commutative arithmetic expressions by @TomasEng in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1752\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* Remove RequiredService from service lookup of INetsWebhookSecretProvi… by @bjorntore in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1742\n* fix: support non-list collections in form wrapper generator by @martinothamar-agent in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1758\n* fix: ignore non-route endpoints in scope auth by @martinothamar-agent in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1759\n### Dependency Upgrades 📦\n* Update nuget non-major dependencies (minor) by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1719\n## New Contributors\n* @martinothamar-agent made their first contribution in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1757\n* @TomasEng made their first contribution in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1751\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.12.0...v8.12.1",
